Subject: [PATCH] Add opt-in CUDA event brackets with bounded host-clock anchors

Windows diagnostic only, explicitly enabled by ITC_TIMELINE_CUDA_OUTPUT.
No CUPTI, graph-capture timing nodes, cache-policy or RPC protocol change.
The first bracket per capture/thread/device synchronizes one anchor event;
completed events are then queried at existing synchronization points.
These are stream-operation intervals, not a complete kernel activity trace.

